{"schemaVersion":1,"id":25,"sections":[{"id":"111010-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[800],"start":0,"count":8},{"id":"111010-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10790],"start":8,"count":13},{"id":"111011-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[810],"start":21,"count":6},{"id":"111011-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10800],"start":27,"count":17},{"id":"111012-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[820],"start":44,"count":19},{"id":"111012-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10810],"start":63,"count":11},{"id":"111013-PROLOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战前","scripts":[830],"start":74,"count":13},{"id":"111013-EPILOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战后","scripts":[10820],"start":87,"count":10},{"id":"111014-PROLOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战前","scripts":[840],"start":97,"count":9},{"id":"111014-EPILOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战后","scripts":[10830],"start":106,"count":10}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:2","scriptId":800,"text":"又经过了一周的时间，离军演的日子还有最后一周。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:3","scriptId":800,"text":"“恩，观察了桑赫斯特先遣队一周，对手的行为方式已经大致掌握了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:4","scriptId":800,"text":"“长官那是标准的跟踪狂行为啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:5","scriptId":800,"text":"“瞎说什么，这么绅士的我，怎么会去偷看她们上厕所和洗澡。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:6","scriptId":800,"text":"“哇……非常不可信的发言……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:8","scriptId":800,"text":"“放心，我派莉娜跟着呢，如果长官有什么图谋不轨就直接打晕拖走。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:9","scriptId":800,"text":"“怪不得莉娜那么主动的和我一起观察敌情……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-PROLOGUE:800:10","scriptId":800,"text":"“♪～♪～♪～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":87,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:1","scriptId":10790,"text":"演练完毕后，在去食堂的路上遇到了桑赫斯特三人组。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":87,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:2","scriptId":10790,"text":"“哟，这么巧啊，你们也是去食堂吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":87,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:3","scriptId":10790,"text":"“你是哪位？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":259,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:4","scriptId":10790,"text":"“好像在哪见过，大众脸记不住名字。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":271,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:5","scriptId":10790,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":271,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:6","scriptId":10790,"text":"“见过面的啦，就是这次伏龙芝军演的指挥官。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:7","scriptId":10790,"text":"“啊，好像有这么回事。那么有何贵干？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":259,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:8","scriptId":10790,"text":"“没什么事，只是看到了打声招呼而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":259,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":269,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:9","scriptId":10790,"text":"“话说回来，在这年头还真的需要指挥官这种东西吗？真是稀有品种。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":269,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:10","scriptId":10790,"text":"“诶？难道桑赫斯特学院没有指挥官？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":269,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:11","scriptId":10790,"text":"“桑赫斯特从前两代起就不再招收军官类学生，都是由各小队长兼任指挥官。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":271,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":269,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:12","scriptId":10790,"text":"“嘛，伏龙芝的教学理念真是有够老套……指挥官这种东西已经是老古董了，上了战场只不过是炮灰而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":269,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111010-EPILOGUE:10790:13","scriptId":10790,"text":"（呃……还真是说话不留余地的人……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":269,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:2","scriptId":810,"text":"傍晚时分，正准备回去休息，看到佐伊急急忙忙地跑了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":269,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:3","scriptId":810,"text":"“长官长官，听说桑赫斯特的队长已经到了，索菲亚教官正在会议室接待她们呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":31,"right":269,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:4","scriptId":810,"text":"“哦？他们小队终于到齐了啊，走！去看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:5","scriptId":810,"text":"和佐伊一起来到了会议室，就看到莉娜奈乐等人都已经齐刷刷的蹲在会议室门口……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:6","scriptId":810,"text":"“呃，大家怎么都来了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-PROLOGUE:810:7","scriptId":810,"text":"“嘘----里面正在交战中♪～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":87,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:1","scriptId":10800,"text":"会议室----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":87,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:2","scriptId":10800,"text":"身材高挑并穿着华丽的红色军服，一看就是桑赫斯特的队员了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":752,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:3","scriptId":10800,"text":"个子娇小，穿着红蓝相间军服的钢舞姬，正在逗弄会议室里面摆放的器械。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":752,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":296,"speaker":"芬妮·朱安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:4","scriptId":10800,"text":"旁边还有位穿着相似服装的钢舞姬，这两个也是桑赫斯特的队员吗？","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":296,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:6","scriptId":10800,"text":"往门缝里张望了一下，看到了好几张生面孔，想必这几位就是桑赫斯特后续队员了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":296,"right":null,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:7","scriptId":10800,"text":"“我严重抗议！桑赫斯特竟然请圣西尔学院的外援！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":null,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:8","scriptId":10800,"text":"“准确地说是圣西尔学院的交换学生啦，因为实力还不错，我就带她们来见见世面咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:9","scriptId":10800,"text":"“这哪里是见见世面……这可是圣西尔学院的顶尖学生，上次和圣西尔军演的时候我可是见过的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:10","scriptId":10800,"text":"“哈哈，过奖过奖～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":295,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:11","scriptId":10800,"text":"“啊啦？是这样吗？我完全不知道啊～况且伏龙芝不也是和西点军校达成统一招生的协议了嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:12","scriptId":10800,"text":"“这完全是两码事，伏龙芝和西点本来就是联校关系。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:13","scriptId":10800,"text":"“那么蕾贝卡裁判，您怎么看这件事情？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:14","scriptId":10800,"text":"“桑赫斯特和圣西尔的混合队伍？听上去挺有意思。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:15","scriptId":10800,"text":"“既然是交换学生那也算是半个桑赫斯特的学生了，反正人都到了，就先这样吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":283,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:16","scriptId":10800,"text":"“索菲亚，你看裁判大人都说没问题了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:17","scriptId":10800,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":220,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111011-EPILOGUE:10800:18","scriptId":10800,"text":"“……好吧，那只能这样了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":216,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:2","scriptId":820,"text":"“看上去都是比较厉害的家伙啊……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:3","scriptId":820,"text":"“有吗？看上去和别的钢舞姬没什么两样啊？”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:6","scriptId":820,"text":"会议室的门“唰啦”一下被打开了，原来是蕾贝卡……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:8","scriptId":820,"text":"“都进来吧，不要蹲在门口偷听了，反正也不是什么大不了的事情啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":223,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:9","scriptId":820,"text":"“啊……被发现了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":225,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:10","scriptId":820,"text":"“你的气息我百里之外都能感受得到啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":225,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:11","scriptId":820,"text":"“正好，大家都在，那么就介绍一下吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:12","scriptId":820,"text":"“我是桑赫斯特这次军演小队的队长奥菲利亚·布鲁克。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":752,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":295,"speaker":"安娜·墨洛温","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:13","scriptId":820,"text":"“安娜·墨洛温，圣西尔交换生，虽然是临时的～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":295,"right":752,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":296,"speaker":"芬妮·朱安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:14","scriptId":820,"text":"“芬妮·朱安，听安娜说有好玩事情，我就跟来了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":295,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:15","scriptId":820,"text":"“…………两位好像说出了不得了的内幕……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":758,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:16","scriptId":820,"text":"“安娜和芬妮不要说多余的事情，咳哼……你们就是伏龙芝的代表了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:17","scriptId":820,"text":"“是的，欢迎你们的到来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":762,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:18","scriptId":820,"text":"“看上去还不错，希望你们能让我玩得愉快一点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":762,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:19","scriptId":820,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":762,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":758,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:20","scriptId":820,"text":"“那我先去看看丹妮丝她们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:21","scriptId":820,"text":"“好的，不要迷路了哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":283,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:22","scriptId":820,"text":"奥菲利亚向着教官的方向挥了挥手，就从会议室离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":283,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-PROLOGUE:820:23","scriptId":820,"text":"（……果然是一个队的，物以类聚啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":758,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:1","scriptId":10810,"text":"伏龙芝贵宾客室----桑赫斯特暂用","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":758,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:2","scriptId":10810,"text":"“恩，大概的战场情报已经收集好了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":758,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":261,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:3","scriptId":10810,"text":"“是的，队长！这次的地形并没有什么特别需要注意的，都属于常见地形。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":261,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":758,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:4","scriptId":10810,"text":"“好的，辛苦你了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":758,"right":261,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":275,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:5","scriptId":10810,"text":"“哪里，这都是我应该做的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":758,"right":275,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":260,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:6","scriptId":10810,"text":"“啊！利薇尔不要抢我台词，那是队长对我说的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":758,"right":260,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:7","scriptId":10810,"text":"“好吧……辛苦你们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":260,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":263,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:8","scriptId":10810,"text":"“为了队长大人，这点小事何足挂齿～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":263,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:9","scriptId":10810,"text":"“那个……安娜和芬妮等会应该会和教官一起回来的。话说回来这里只有你们俩？塞姬人呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":263,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":265,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:10","scriptId":10810,"text":"“肯定又去哪里玩了吧，每到一个新地方她都这样，要到处探险。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":265,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111012-EPILOGUE:10810:11","scriptId":10810,"text":"“也罢，随她去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":752,"right":265,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:2","scriptId":830,"text":"隔天早上，全队都被索菲亚教官叫到会议室……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":752,"right":265,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:3","scriptId":830,"text":"“大家都到了，那我就开始了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":265,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:4","scriptId":830,"text":"“这次桑赫斯特的阵容比以往要强大，加入了圣西尔的两位强力后援。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":216,"right":265,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:5","scriptId":830,"text":"“不过好在这两位后援的信息我还是知道一些，所以要和你们说一下这些家伙的能力。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":265,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:6","scriptId":830,"text":"“那太好了，这些信息肯定对我们拟定作战计划有很大帮助。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":103,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:7","scriptId":830,"text":"（其实反过来想想，我们好像比桑赫斯特更犯规……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:8","scriptId":830,"text":"“特别是莉娜和佐伊，遇到这两位的时候切忌不能正面作战，一对一不可能存在胜算。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":103,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:9","scriptId":830,"text":"“诶？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":41,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:10","scriptId":830,"text":"“就算是卓娅也最好不要正面很她们对着干，火力远在我们之上，特别是那爆发力极强的连续炮击。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":41,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:11","scriptId":830,"text":"“恩？她们竟然有那么强？说得我真是有点心痒痒，想要立刻和她们比试一下呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":163,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:12","scriptId":830,"text":"“最讨厌的是她们两个的连携性很强，灵活又多变的协同攻击，消灭一个队伍都没有问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":163,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":350,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:13","scriptId":830,"text":"“那就只能拆散她们以后逐个击破了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":218,"right":350,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-PROLOGUE:830:14","scriptId":830,"text":"“估计很困难……得想些对策。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:1","scriptId":10820,"text":"敌人大致的一些情报已经从索菲亚教官那里获得了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:2","scriptId":10820,"text":"因为有些比较在意的事情，想去档案室看看有没有相关记录。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:3","scriptId":10820,"text":"“如果能知道一点桑赫斯特与圣西尔的对战情况就好了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:4","scriptId":10820,"text":"突然一个声音从背后亮了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:5","scriptId":10820,"text":"“这还不简单，问塞姬就行了，塞姬虽然年龄不大，但是什么都知道哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:6","scriptId":10820,"text":"“诶？塞姬你是从哪里冒出来的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:7","scriptId":10820,"text":"“恩～塞姬，正在探险中，伏龙芝学院好大啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:8","scriptId":10820,"text":"“那个……关于桑赫斯特与圣西尔的对战情况能不能详细和我说一说？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:9","scriptId":10820,"text":"“好啊，丹妮丝她们都不陪我玩，我正无聊着呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111013-EPILOGUE:10820:10","scriptId":10820,"text":"（这真是得来全不费工夫……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:2","scriptId":840,"text":"钢舞姬训练场，索菲亚教官正在对佐伊她们进行锻炼。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":298,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:3","scriptId":840,"text":"“这几天都没看到长官，不知道他去哪摸鱼了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":41,"right":298,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:4","scriptId":840,"text":"“有索菲亚教官在监督体能训练，完全足够了。长官可能在研究战术吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":41,"right":103,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:5","scriptId":840,"text":"“那小子如果敢在这时候偷懒，看我不拆了他的骨头！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":216,"right":103,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:6","scriptId":840,"text":"这时，蕾贝卡走了进来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":216,"right":103,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":225,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:7","scriptId":840,"text":"“看样子训练得还不错嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":216,"right":225,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:8","scriptId":840,"text":"“还好吧，桑赫斯特那边如何？我看她们一直粘着沙狐的成员。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":225,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:9","scriptId":840,"text":"“也就是聊聊北非时候的战绩而已，我让露米娜去应付了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":223,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-PROLOGUE:840:10","scriptId":840,"text":"“哼，到了新场地也不演练一下，她们还真的挺游刃有余啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":223,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:1","scriptId":10830,"text":"明天就要开战了，进行最后的确认。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":223,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:2","scriptId":10830,"text":"“明天早上七时就会开始第一轮夺旗赛，也是最最关键的一场。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:3","scriptId":10830,"text":"“诶？为什么第一场战斗那么重要？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:4","scriptId":10830,"text":"“因为第一批空投物资也会出现在赛场上，物资争夺对后面几场战斗会产生雪崩效应。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":41,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:5","scriptId":10830,"text":"“没错，就如奈乐说的，物资争夺其实才是第一场夺旗战的核心。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:6","scriptId":10830,"text":"“不过说到物资？旗帜的位置是事先被告知的，但是物资的出现位置是完全随机的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:7","scriptId":10830,"text":"“所以在夺旗的同时，还要收集那些散落在各处的物资，战斗力会被分散开……当然，关于这点这个我自有对策。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":163,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:8","scriptId":10830,"text":"“看样子应该没什么特别大的问题，虽然还是有些担心，不过这之后就交给你处理了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:9","scriptId":10830,"text":"“从明天开始两边的教官都只能在观测席看你们比赛了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111014-EPILOGUE:10830:10","scriptId":10830,"text":"“恩，放心吧。让我来教教桑赫斯特的学生们真正的指挥官是什么样子！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false}],"summaries":["平静的一周，离军演还有一周。","桑赫斯特的剩余队员也终于来到了伏龙芝。","桑赫斯特的队员到齐了。","隔天早上，被索菲亚教官叫到会议室……","从塞姬那里得到了一些相当有用的情报……"]}
